 -0.024076875299215317, 0.012879698537290096, -0.015849348157644272, 0.019163914024829865, -0.03243900462985039, -0.022730858996510506, 0.03799132630228996, -0.019062962383031845, -0.0065365941263735294, 0.0250190868973732, -0.014823010191321373, -0.028619682416319847, 0.013056362979114056, -0.013434930704534054, 0.012972237542271614, -0.02296641282737255, -0.01037274207919836, -0.02264673262834549, 0.006746909115463495, -0.033465344458818436, 0.022327054291963577, 0.006115964148193598, -0.004172652028501034, -0.021990550681948662, 0.026953987777233124, 0.0028771108482033014, 0.015310941264033318, 0.015453956089913845, -0.02826635353267193], "index": 9, "object": "embedding"}], "model": "text-embedding-3-small", "object": "list", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8000, "total_tokens": 8000}}, "input": {"input": [" id=\"m69b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:29:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I told them Sienna was there for a moment. Then Alex, and then me. We were all there at some point.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m70\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:29:31+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s exactly when the ferry slowed down near Kirribilli and the jacket was found by the rail. The timing is damning.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m70a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:29:56+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He asked about a metallic snap sound. I mentioned that Zoe’s audio might have captured it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m70b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:30:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I handed them the SD card. They’re going to image it and then return a copy to me. Standard procedure.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m71\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:31:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I was on the lower deck at that point. Nausea. The crew saw me there. I have an alibi.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m71a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:31:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The deckhand with the yellow gloves can vouch for me. He even offered me a glass of water.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m71b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:32:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The detective asked for his name. None of us caught it. He was just a face in the chaos. A ghost.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m71c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:32:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Update: crew list shows the deckhand was Jax Morgan. Yellow gloves guy has a name now.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m72\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:33:04+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I asked about the drug screens. They came back negative for any sedatives. So it wasn’t a push and not a dose.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m72a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:33:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They’re still waiting on the full toxicology report, but the preliminary results are clear. No foul play there.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m72b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:33:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>", "26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>They’re still waiting on the full toxicology report, but the preliminary results are clear. No foul play there.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m72b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:33:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>So it was the mechanism, not chemistry. The fishing line theory is holding up. It’s the most logical explanation.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m73\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:36:28+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The USB headers show an encrypted volume with a custom label. It’s stylish, and annoyingly clever.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m73a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:36:52+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I didn’t mount it. I just looked at the metadata. They were happy about that. I didn't tamper with evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m73b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:37:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Good. That way they can’t claim you tampered with anything. Smart move, Alex.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m74\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:37:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Can you see the full label without unlocking the drive? Any clues there?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m74a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:37:28+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: Only a partial. It says VOL-SAI… and then it’s just garbled. It could be an in-joke or a code.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m74b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:37:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Keep that between us for now. It could be our ace in the hole. Don't share it with the others yet.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m75\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:37:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: It's only “VOL-” and then gibberish. It could be themed. Something artsy. Someone with a creative flair.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m75a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:38:29+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Everything you touch doesn’t automatically become evidence just because it’s pretty, Alex. Stop reaching.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m75b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:39:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Focus on how Liam fell, not on my old file names", " ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Everything you touch doesn’t automatically become evidence just because it’s pretty, Alex. Stop reaching.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m75b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:39:12+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Focus on how Liam fell, not on my old file names. That’s what’s important right now. A man is dead.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m76\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:40:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Artsy doesn’t equal guilty. Don’t you dare do that. You’re grasping at straws and pointing fingers.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m76a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:41:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The detective said they’ll inspect the ferry rail at low tide tomorrow. They're looking for physical evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m76b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:41:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>If they don’t do a thorough job, we will. Photos, measurements, the works. We owe it to Liam.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m76c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:42:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Detective Barber just texted: “No touching. If you’re there first, photos only, chalk for scale. We’ll supervise if we can.”</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m76d\" ts=\"2025-08-30T11:42:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Copy. Photos under instruction. No removing anything.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"5\" title=\"Passphrase\">\n    <message id=\"m77\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:02:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I might have a breakthrough. I tried “HarbourLights” again: nothing. But then something else just clicked into place.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m77a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:02:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The volume label fragment looked like “SAILS…”. So, I tried a phrase from last night. A long shot.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m77b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:02:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>You used Sienna’s poetic line? That’s… a pointed accusation, Alex. You better be sure about this.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m78\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:03:27+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>What was the exact phrase you used? Don't leave us hanging. This could", "receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>You used Sienna’s poetic line? That’s… a pointed accusation, Alex. You better be sure about this.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m78\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:03:27+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>What was the exact phrase you used? Don't leave us hanging. This could be it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m78a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:03:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>If this is some kind of sick joke, it isn’t funny at all. You’re playing with fire, Alex.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m79\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:04:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>“the sails look like they’re breathing” — typed exactly as she said it last night. Verbatim.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m79a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:04:33+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It mounted a hidden volume. The root directory has documents and a chat export. It’s all here.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m79a1\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:04:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>First glance: file named INV_HC_041_curation.pdf. That label again.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m79b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:04:50+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Share the filenames, not the files themselves, here. We’ll hand the entire drive in. No more secrets.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m79c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:04:54+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We used that “sails” line as a silly in‑group password months ago for a shared photo dump. It wasn’t meant to implicate anyone.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m80\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:04:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That’s just something I said about the city lights. It’s not a digital signature. This is ridiculous.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m80a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:05:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It was a shared passphrase. Not just mine. Not Sienna’s alone. We all used it for... things.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m80b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:05:38+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I reused it for the USB because I’m lazy. I set the label; Sienna didn’t touch the config.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m81\" ts=\"2025-", " it for... things.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m80b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:05:38+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I reused it for the USB because I’m lazy. I set the label; Sienna didn’t touch the config.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m81\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:06:45+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Inside: invoices, shipping manifests, and a detailed chat log. “HC” pays “Deckie.” The dates match Liam’s shifts perfectly.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m81a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:07:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>One manifest: crate 4B-KIR, transfer scheduled for “after the lights,” handler listed as: Deckie. It's all laid out.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m81b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:07:24+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>A chat excerpt mentions a “white bay lock-up” and a “curation receipt.” This is getting deeper and deeper.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m81c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:07:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>“After lights” matches our ferry time window exactly. This was all supposed to happen last night.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m82\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:08:32+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>“Deckie” was Liam’s code name. He moved sealed crates from the quay to a storage unit. They were legal goods. I thought.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m82a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:08:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He was paid above board through HC. It was stupid and traceable, I know that now. I wasn't thinking straight.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m83\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:10:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>There’s a consignment note to a White Bay lock-up with a curator’s signature. Sienna? Care to explain?</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m83a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:10:28+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I wrote receipts for condition checks on the items, not to hide anything. That's my job. It's what I do.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m83b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:10:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The note says “temporary storage pending provenance confirmation.” That’s a massive red flag in the art world.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m84\" ts", " That's my job. It's what I do.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m83b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:10:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The note says “temporary storage pending provenance confirmation.” That’s a massive red flag in the art world.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m84\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:12:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I catalogued some art pieces for a private donor. That’s it. You’re twisting my words and my actions.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m84a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:12:52+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We’ll let the detectives pull on these threads. But the origin of the passphrase is what matters now. It's a direct link.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m84b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:13:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>All of this speculation still doesn’t answer the most important question: how did he fall? We need to focus on that.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m84c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:13:49+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>It narrows down why someone might have wanted to set a trap for him. The motive is becoming clearer.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m84d\" ts=\"2025-08-30T16:14:10+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I didn’t do it. Say it again if you must, but I didn't. I'm innocent of that, at least.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"6\" title=\"Ghost Accounts\">\n    <message id=\"m85\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:41:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I'm tracing the payments now. “Harbour Consulting” funnels money to a company called “SB Holdings” via two neobanks.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m85a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:42:08+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The intermediate accounts are Pacific One and TideWave. It’s a round-trip payment within 48 hours. Classic money laundering.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m85b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:41:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Out of order timestamps? That's a red flag. Screenshot everything before they have a chance to vanish.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m86\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:42:37+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>“SB” as in Sienna Blake? That’s not exactly subtle, is it? A bit on the nose.</body>\n    </message>\n    <", "'s a red flag. Screenshot everything before they have a chance to vanish.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m86\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:42:37+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>“SB” as in Sienna Blake? That’s not exactly subtle, is it? A bit on the nose.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m86a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:42:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Or Southbound. Or Sandstone Bridge. Shell companies love using initials; that much is true. It means nothing.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m86b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:43:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The articles of incorporation for SB Holdings list a trustee. I’ll forward all of this to the police. They can untangle it.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m87\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:43:20+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Shells name things after their owners' initials all the time. Ask Marcus about his own company. It's common practice.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m87a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:43:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Mine was called MC Logistics. Subtle as a brick, I know. I was young and foolish. We all make mistakes.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m87b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:43:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The detectives are going to love this pattern. The motive is getting very crowded. This is a tangled web.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m88\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:45:02+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I can’t defend the accounts. It was stupid. But I didn’t kill him. He threatened to go public; I panicked, I wasn't violent.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m88a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:45:24+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I told him to just wait. We could have exited cleanly. But he said “tonight or never.” He was determined.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m88b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:45:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>And now he’s gone forever. Everyone has to sit with that. There are real consequences to our actions.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m89\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:47:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Liam texted me last week: “If I vanish, take a close look at the stern rail screws.” A warning.</body>\n    </message>\n    <", " to sit with that. There are real consequences to our actions.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m89\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:47:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: Liam texted me last week: “If I vanish, take a close look at the stern rail screws.” A warning.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m89b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:47:30+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: He added “I can’t skip that path; duty requires a stern sweep each run. Might just be loose hardware.”</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m89a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:47:39+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: He knew something specific was wrong with that rail. Maybe he was trying to warn us about a trap.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m90\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:48:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <body>DM: That’s incredibly specific. We absolutely need photos of that rail at low tide. No matter what.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m90a\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:48:59+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <body>DM: I’ll bring a ruler and some chalk. We can mark any scuffs without actually touching anything. Preserve the evidence.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m90b\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:49:21+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Tomorrow at noon looks like the lowest tide. Let's meet at the Kirribilli steps. We need to do this for Liam.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m90c\" ts=\"2025-08-30T18:49:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ll bring gloves and a camera with a macro lens. We need to document everything perfectly.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"7\" title=\"Crosscurrents\">\n    <message id=\"m91\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:12:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I’ve been checking injury patterns. A sudden jerk could have easily flipped him over if a line snagged his wrist unexpectedly.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m91a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:12:34+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The angle of his fall would have been backwards, toward the water, if he was pulled at wrist height. It all fits.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m91b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:12:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The rail height and Liam’s own height make that a feasible scenario. It’s a perfect storm of factors.</body>\n    </message", " fall would have been backwards, toward the water, if he was pulled at wrist height. It all fits.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m91b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:12:55+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The rail height and Liam’s own height make that a feasible scenario. It’s a perfect storm of factors.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m92\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:13:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The backpack had monofilament line. The thin kind designed for high tension, it's almost invisible in the dark.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m92a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:13:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Monofilament bites into the skin cleanly. My fisher uncles used to warn me about it all the time. It’s nasty stuff.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m92b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:13:41+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Which perfectly matches the uniform bruise I saw on his wrist. This is no accident. It was a setup.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m93\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:14:40+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>So, a freak fishing accident? You are all making up wild conspiracies in the middle of the harbour.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m93a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:14:58+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>An accident doesn’t pre-tie a high-tension line to a ferry rail, Sienna. That's premeditated.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m93b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:15:19+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>And it certainly doesn’t leave scuff marks that are aligned like a guide. This was carefully planned.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m94\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:16:28+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>I argued with him about refusing to do another run for me. I walked away. That’s the absolute truth.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m94a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:16:51+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"marcus\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>He said, “no more crates.” I said, “we’ll talk about it tomorrow.” He left angry, and that was the last time I saw him.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m94b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:17:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We all left angry last night. Context matters. Emotions were running high for everyone.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m94c\" ts=\"202", " angry, and that was the last time I saw him.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m94b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:17:09+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>We all left angry last night. Context matters. Emotions were running high for everyone.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m94c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:17:26+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Crew SOP has deckhands do a stern sweep around 18:50 on that route. He had to go back there.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m95\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:18:05+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>The CCTV footage near the stern has a convenient blind strip. But my audio picks up a distinct snap at 18:50:34, and then a gasp.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m95a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:18:24+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>A blind spot plus a nearly invisible line equals premeditation, not a simple stumble. It's murder.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m95b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:18:46+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Let’s verify everything with the rail photos at noon today. We need undeniable proof before we go to the police.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m95c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:19:01+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Camera 3 flares when the ferry turns east; mast vibration + cabin lights make a 20‑second glare window. Someone knew that.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m96\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:19:42+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"alex\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>That snap sound could be the line under tension. If someone deliberately set a trap at the rail…</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m96a\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:20:03+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"zoe\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>…they knew the swell patterns and Liam’s exact route on the deck during his shift. It was an inside job.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m96b\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:20:18+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"sienna\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Or they just panicked and did something incredibly stupid. People do that all the time. It doesn't have to be a grand conspiracy.</body>\n    </message>\n    <message id=\"m96c\" ts=\"2025-08-31T06:20:36+10:00\">\n      <sender ref=\"priya\"/>\n      <receiver ref=\"six\"/>\n      <body>Mechanism fits: line jerk → fall over stern → cold shock on immersion. No drugs needed for collapse.</body>\n    </message>\n  </chapter>\n  <chapter id=\"8\" title=\"Low Tide"], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small"}}, "key": "embeddings_0f9228655f2da14f3ea42555792d4ce006d9b8603acb0d334e4cd67a70aa7602_v2"}